DirkuLator 0.5.10 (performance, rendering unchanged): the per-draw diagnostics in GraphicsPipeline::ConfigureImpl (050 depth
samplers, 0.3 table census, watched-target draws, 0.2 capture constant buffers) run only when
/data/eden-nx2/draw-diagnostics.txt exists. GPU-thread draw cost was ~24.5 us/draw in 0.5.8 gameplay.

